&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading channel or partner teams across multiple EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers, distributors, service providers, and strategic alliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of driving partner-sourced pipeline and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and executing partner business plans, joint go-to-market strategies, and regional growth plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead a distributed team across multiple countries and create strong operating cadence and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and operational discipline, including forecasting, pipeline management, and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with direct sales, marketing, pre-sales, customer success, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
