&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Influence Executive&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Department:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;London&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Contact type: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;12-Month Fixed Term Contract&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; Full Time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Reporting into: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Business Director&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Onefluence is seeking a dynamic and trend-savvy Senior Influencer Executive to join our team dedicated to L&#39;Oréal. The ideal candidate will be responsible for driving successful influencer marketing campaigns that align with L&#39;Oréal&#39;s brand objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Influencer Executive, you will lead influencer strategy and campaign execution across social platforms to amplify brand awareness, drive engagement, and grow our community within the beauty space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for managing influencer relationships, developing creative campaign concepts, and ensuring brand alignment with both macro and micro creators.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influencer Strategy &amp;amp; Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute influencer campaigns for new product launches, brand awareness, and seasonal initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and onboard relevant beauty influencers (macro, micro, and nano) across TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, and emerging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage influencer briefs, contracts, timelines, and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee influencer content production to ensure brand tone, aesthetic, and compliance with marketing guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with top-tier beauty influencers, talent managers, and agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for influencer collaborations and ongoing partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyse influencer campaign performance using analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver insights and recommendations to optimize future campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on ROI, engagement metrics, and audience growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with PR, social media, e-commerce, and creative teams to ensure consistent messaging and amplification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integrated marketing initiatives that combine influencer, content, and brand storytelling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of experience in influencer marketing, preferably within the beauty, cosmetics, or lifestyle industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of social media platforms and influencer ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and relationship management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with experience using tools like Traackr, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative eye for beauty trends, social storytelling, and content aesthetics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and stakeholders in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network of beauty influencers or creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with paid and seeding influencer amplification or affiliate programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of emerging platforms (e.g., TikTok Shop, Threads, YouTube Shorts).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Director,&amp;nbsp;People Experience&amp;nbsp;EMEA&amp;nbsp;and is part of&amp;nbsp;the global&amp;nbsp;PX&amp;nbsp;team. The role will be looking&amp;nbsp;after for all&amp;nbsp;operational elements of HR and&amp;nbsp;is part of the core foundation to the success of our HR Operating model and enables us to continue to build&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;smooth and efficient&amp;nbsp;employee experiences. Successful candidates will have worked in similar sized organisations with a remit of multiple countries.&amp;nbsp;The remit is currently growing as we are centralising European Tier 1 activity into the&amp;nbsp;center.&amp;nbsp;The team consists of focused Advisory teams based in London as well as HR Managers who have hybrid roles (Tier 1 and Tier 2) based in France,&amp;nbsp;Germany&amp;nbsp;and Spain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable&amp;nbsp;for all activity associated with&amp;nbsp;first line&amp;nbsp;HR support (Tier 1), this includes:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;data integrity which feeds into Payroll&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reporting. Key&amp;nbsp;HR&amp;nbsp;systems are Workday and ServiceNow (Nexus&amp;nbsp;tickets);&amp;nbsp;implement&amp;nbsp;HR policies consistently,&amp;nbsp;oversee&amp;nbsp;country specific&amp;nbsp;onboarding,&amp;nbsp;offboarding, benefit administration,&amp;nbsp;, administration of employee changes&amp;nbsp;(starter, leaver, changes), employee screening,&amp;nbsp;Right to Work checks,&amp;nbsp;HR compliance, Tier&amp;nbsp;1&amp;nbsp;ticketing SLAs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;improvement and&amp;nbsp;tech stack&amp;nbsp;automation focus&amp;nbsp;across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with key roles in the wider HR team such as PX Consultants, in-house Legal team,&amp;nbsp;Payroll team,&amp;nbsp;Global Mobility,&amp;nbsp;PTS (technology),&amp;nbsp;COEs (Talent, DEI, Total Rewards etc) as well as regional leaders to ensure you have a deep understanding of business needs and ability to schedule team resource. The key is to continuously improve and develop operational support best practice and review opportunities for improvement with a global lens even when the role is regional.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In partnership with the&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;Director&amp;nbsp;People&amp;nbsp;Experience&amp;nbsp;and senior stakeholders, scope requirements for HR Operations across Europe with the aim to&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;and maintain a full European HR Operations service. Countries&amp;nbsp;currently in scope&amp;nbsp;include France, Germany, Netherlands,&amp;nbsp;Belgium,&amp;nbsp;Spain, Portugal,&amp;nbsp;Italy,&amp;nbsp;UK&amp;nbsp;and Ireland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the&amp;nbsp;team’s&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;adoption&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;successful&amp;nbsp;achievement of&amp;nbsp;current SLAs and KPIs on the Nexus ticketing system,&amp;nbsp;goals&amp;nbsp;and continuous improvement projects&amp;nbsp;to align with changing business needs and re-establish a customer focused and proactive approach across the team&amp;nbsp;and line&amp;nbsp;with the globalisation of our function.&amp;nbsp;Coach, develop&amp;nbsp;and train team members to avoid single point dependencies and&amp;nbsp;build for&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;and knowledge sharing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;relevant external supplier relationships and regularly review their SLAs&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;pre-employment screening,&amp;nbsp;Right to Work checks&amp;nbsp;etc)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;well as the budget related to yearly activities for Tier1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present regular&amp;nbsp;reports to leadership&amp;nbsp;to illustrate KPIs, changes in processes/policies, noticeable&amp;nbsp;trends&amp;nbsp;and project&amp;nbsp;updates&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;reflective&amp;nbsp;learnings&amp;nbsp;as well as proactive&amp;nbsp;forward looking&amp;nbsp;focal&amp;nbsp;points.&amp;nbsp;This role requires strong collaboration communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mechanisms&amp;nbsp;to enable a self-service culture by ensuring core platforms are regularly reviewed and&amp;nbsp;maintained&amp;nbsp;including knowledge articles and regularly reviewing training material for the team and the business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads a continuous improvement culture, driving ongoing development, evaluation/testing, and maintenance of processes and documentation (e.g., Tier 0 Knowledge Base, Standard Operating Procedures).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects to improve processes and technology e.g. implementing screening, integrating new work streams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain&amp;nbsp;appropriate confidentiality&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;all of&amp;nbsp;the above, ensuring legal and compliance requirements are met (e.g. employment legislation, data protection etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of managing an operational HR services function with multi-site accountability&amp;nbsp;across EMEA, with specifically working with SLAs/KPIs through a ticketing system&amp;nbsp;and managing a team of 5-10&amp;nbsp;direct reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven line management capability with a focus on driving performance,&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;development,&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;improvement as well as evolve the model as centralisation progresses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing&amp;nbsp;new technologies&amp;nbsp;and/or harmonising multiple systems&amp;nbsp;and simplify / automate processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience of building collaborative relationships across the business and HR to gain a detailed understanding of commercial drivers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal&amp;nbsp;and numeracy skills with the ability to present to senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse data/information and interpret it into recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong eye for detail with a pragmatic approach to solving problems&amp;nbsp;and working well under pressure with&amp;nbsp;multiple project deliveries at any one time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong IT skills with a focus on Microsoft Office and HRIS such as Workday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven HR&amp;nbsp;advisory&amp;nbsp;experience and can provide advice associated with employment regulations and procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience in complex matrix global organisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational HR experience across multiple countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with in the Tech or Gaming industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree level education or CIPD qualified.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&lt;/li&gt;
